[I] A GNOME IDE library

[T] This tool aims to extract much of what makes GNOME Builder an IDE into a
[T] library and companion command-line tool.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/foundry

[A] The GNOME Project <gnome-devel-list@gnome.org>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/tool extra/desktop/gnome
[F] CROSS

[L] LGPL
[V] 1.2.0

[D] 01b8900d9f804229d05d12329531a8bea14ba75a51c666c0176a34d9 foundry-1.2.0.tar.gz https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/foundry/-/archive/1.2.0/

var_append GCC_WRAPPER_REMOVE ' ' -I$(pkgprefix includedir libsoup)/libsoup-2.4

pkginstalled webkitgtk || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dwebkit=false
pkginstalled gobject-introspection || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dintrospection=disabled
